From 8960721db7ad5e84fe20128b4211a5386037b569 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Horizon authors <>
Date: Fri, 23 Oct 2026 15:09:08 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Patch 0170: the evolution chart lists every partner species.
 The overview is one tab per level (Baby, Rookie, Champion, Ultimate, Mega;
 L1/R1), a page of 14 x 7 boxes in the level's colour (the D-pad past the edge
 turns the page), the raised species' name and the tab's raised/total and page
 on the bottom row; the list and the icons come from DIGI.DAT's chart block
 (SpeciesHeader.chartSector, readSpeciesChart), read per page into the
 battle-effect VRAM; the sheet's 61 keep their hand-drawn icons

---
 include/dw/species.h   |  17 +-
 src/main/game_menu.c   | 510 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++-------------
 src/main/mod_species.c |  12 +
 3 files changed, 380 insertions(+), 159 deletions(-)

